SUMMARY:Change to Arboretum Stroll for Friday's Hike
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**DETAILS**\n\n* 3 to 4 mile easy 
 pace hike.\n* Carpool - 8am at Tanger Outlets parking lot behind the Waffl
 e House (link labeled Asheville Outlets)\, 8:15 at Arboretum Education Cen
 ter.\n* I have increased the number of spaces available for this hike.\n\n
 This was formerly the Looking Glass Rock hike but I've decided it is too w
 arm for that hike this week. We will do a 3 or 4 mile stroll around the Ar
 boretum in place of that hike. It is mostly shaded and will be a comfortab
 le pace to visit.\n\n**CARPOOL**\nParking is plentiful at the Arboretum bu
 t if you don't have a pass please meet at. the Tanger Outlets by 8am. We w
 ill head to the Arboretum for about an 8:15 start to our hike.\n\n**WEATHE
 R**\nI'll watch the weather and post a cancellation message by 7:00 AM if 
 the forecast is >50% chance of precipitation.\n\n**QUESTIONS?**\nYou can m
 essage me through MeetUp until 8:00 AM the day of. Cell reception may be s
 ketchy\, but you can try to text or call me up to the start of the hike: (
 508) 965-2333.\n\n**LEGALESE**\nThis Asheville Hiking Group event involves
  hiking and\, possibly\, transportation to and from the meetup site. Parti
 cipants are responsible for their own safety and affirm that they have the
  appropriate skills\, physical conditioning\, equipment\, and supplies. Hi
 king may involve risks to oneself and property. Neither your hike organize
 r nor Asheville Hiking Group can assure your safety nor eliminate all risk
 s. Participants assume full responsibility for any injuries\, damages\, or
  losses.
